  "behavior": [
    "A transition acquire proved Superseded may deliver one positively journaled successor within the original caller deadline. Held intents reconcile exactly. Unknown allocations keep the original intent; repeated supersession stops without a third intent. The helper also serves child archives.",
    "Keep the original seven-response-sized intrinsic-fit check, then retain only the live catalog page. Transfer each delivered inventory response into the seal collection with its immutable byte charge. Release active work slots only after delivery; drop observations before their retained byte guards.",
    "Keep shared placement data and existing placement ownership unchanged. Preserve authenticated peer and boot checks, complete physical inventory, sample age, projected birth/capacity accounting, catalog token revalidation and final directory CAS.",
    "Add the missing tracing workspace dev-dependency to the shared recovery harness and its locked dependency edge; no package version changes."
  ],
  "before_after_oracles": [
    "At the original byte-identical source-acquire fixture checkpoint, before-03 has four passes and one failure and source-acquire after-01 has five passes. The final fixture changes only post-assertion retention I/O; setup, fault injection and all five test bodies remain byte-identical. Real conditional registry/journal operations cover an exact late physical allocation, unknown journal readback, held intent reconciliation and repeated supersession.",
    "With identical admission fixtures, the memory baseline has one pass and one failure and both actual six-voter CLI authorization scenarios refuse at physical-inventory peer_overloaded in seven milliseconds. The candidate passes both controls and both complete native scenarios.",
    "The native admission fixture holds entered periodic trust reads behind the original cut and retains one actual unpolled response admission. A separate known policy write advances the required cut. It does not replace the original transition request, enlarge its bank/deadline or supply an authority proof.",
    "The admission-only unit model covers six retained inventory responses plus fresh trust at every target and preserves intrinsic-fit refusal. It grants no physical/archive coverage. Native cases retain all original authorization, routing, business-state and joined-close assertions."
  ],
